  unitName: Arcane Solo Eric
  unitId: 60365
  unitNumber: 547
  description: A former cavalry leader who wanders through the Bariura Empire as
    a musician. When Magress took on the gods, he aided him from the shadows on numerous
    occasions. The more he used his altered powers, the stronger yet more uncontrollable
    they became. Though he despised his power, he used it to save others until his
    performances took on a life of their own. Legend has it his cursed melodies could
    possess the gods and force them to fight against each other.
  summonDesc: Summoning is an interesting power.<br>Maybe I should protect you so<br>it
    doesn't consume you?
  fusionDesc: My strength is multiplying...<br>But don't worry. I'm too<br>old to
    run wild again.
  evoDesc: Hmm... This is strange.<br>I hate this power, but it<br>invigorates me
    all the same.
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
